"text": "For your New Year’s company party at a casual restaurant, I’ve put together an outfit that turns coral into the star while grounding it with earthy and cool tones. Your cocktail dress in coral velvet is cinched at the waist to highlight your defined shape, and its large black floral print adds boldness without overwhelming you. The deep green patent ballet flats bring a festive pop of color that echoes the holiday spirit, while the brown suede crossbody bag offers a rich, neutral anchor with a practical yet elegant silhouette. Together, these pieces create a balanced look where the warm coral meets the cool green and brown for a dynamic but sophisticated evening appearance.",
"how_to_wear": [
"For your restaurant visit, leave the dress alone at first—let the bold print and color speak before adjusting anything.",
"To add drama without cluttering the look, keep accessories minimal: let the gold hardware on the bag shine as the only metal accent."
],
